software developer is now.

00:32:57.190 --> 00:33:00.760
It's sort of becoming basic
tools and techniques for doing

00:33:00.760 --> 00:33:03.190
almost every job over time.

00:33:03.190 --> 00:33:05.620
I read an article that Rio
Tinto, one of the biggest

00:33:05.620 --> 00:33:07.480
gold-mining companies
in the world,

00:33:07.480 --> 00:33:11.110
says that the future miners
will be software developers.

00:33:11.110 --> 00:33:13.010
And they're not
talking about bitcoin.

00:33:13.010 --> 00:33:14.470
They're talking
about programming

00:33:14.470 --> 00:33:18.100
