underground and free humans

00:33:18.100 --> 00:33:21.472
from mine collapses and dull,
dirty, and dangerous work.

00:33:21.472 --> 00:33:22.930
Pharmaceutical
companies are saying

00:33:22.930 --> 00:33:25.720
the future of pharmaceutical
discovery is programming.

00:33:25.720 --> 00:33:29.470
So I think this is just kind
of a renaissance for people

00:33:29.470 --> 00:33:31.720
who care about
producing good outcomes

00:33:31.720 --> 00:33:35.350
and like to spend time
and focus and flow,

00:33:35.350 --> 00:33:40.250
building logical expressions
of what ought to get done.

00:33:40.250 --> 00:33:41.650
So come on in.

00:33:41.650 --> 00:33:42.730
The water's great.

00:33:42.730 --> 00:33:45.160
And we'll continue to try
to make it better for you.

00:33:45.160 --> 00:33:45.420
MELANIE WARRICK: Great.

